# Spring Boot & Framework Rules
# Applies to: Configuration, profiles, dependency injection, security

---

## Configuration Files

```
src/main/resources/
├── application.properties             # Main configuration
├── application-hsqldb.properties      # HSQLDB database profile
├── application-mysql.properties       # MySQL database profile
├── application-postgresql.properties  # PostgreSQL database profile
└── openapi.yml                        # API specification
```

---

## Profile System

### Active Profiles
```properties
# application.properties
# Format: spring.profiles.active=database,repository

# Default configuration
spring.profiles.active=hsqldb,spring-data-jpa
```

### Database Profiles
| Profile | Database | Type |
|---------|----------|------|
| `hsqldb` | HSQLDB | In-memory (default) |
| `mysql` | MySQL | Persistent |
| `postgresql` | PostgreSQL | Persistent |

### Repository Profiles
| Profile | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| `spring-data-jpa` | Spring Data JPA (default) |
| `jpa` | JPA/EntityManager |
| `jdbc` | Spring JDBC |

