## Bean Naming Conventions

| Type | Naming Pattern | Example |
|------|---------------|---------|
| Configuration | `*Config.java` | `SwaggerConfig.java` |
| Service Interface | `*Service.java` | `ClinicService.java` |
| Service Impl | `*ServiceImpl.java` | `ClinicServiceImpl.java` |
| Repository Interface | `*Repository.java` | `OwnerRepository.java` |
| Spring Data Repo | `SpringData*Repository.java` | `SpringDataOwnerRepository.java` |
| Controller | `*RestController.java` | `OwnerRestController.java` |
| Mapper | `*Mapper.java` | `OwnerMapper.java` |

