## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Use field injection | Use constructor injection |
| Hardcode configuration | Use properties files |
| Forget profile annotations | Use `@Profile` or `@ConditionalOnProperty` |
| Mix profiles incorrectly | Use format: database,repository |
| Enable security without roles | Define roles in `Roles.java` |
